Shortcut: IOTCEDPP

Scan QR code or barcode

Get URLs from QR/Barcode

Show alert: URLs

Get contents of URLs
  Method: GET
  Headers:
    Accept: application/vnd.iotcedpp.capture+json

Show alert: Contents of URL

Get dictionary from Contents of URL

Show alert: Dictionary

Get Value for links in Dictionary

Show alert: Dictionary Value

Get First Item from Dictionary Value

Show alert: Item from List

Get Value for href in Item from List

Show alert: Dictionary Value

If Dictionary Value has any value

    Text
      POST IoT sensor data

    Show alert: Text

    List
      Location
      Activity
      Battery
      Condition
      Availability
      Weather
      Manual

    Choose from List

    Show alert: Selected Item

    Set variable SensorType to Selected Item

    Show alert: SensorType

    If SensorType contains Location

        Get current location

        Get Latitude from Current Location

        Get Longitude from Current Location

        Text
          Lat: [Latitude], Lon: [Longitude]

        Show alert: Text

        Set variable SensorValue to Text

    Otherwise

        If SensorType contains Activity

            Get Physical Activity

            Text
              Physical Movement: [Get Physical Activity]

            Show alert: Text

            Set variable SensorValue to Text

        Otherwise

            If SensorType contains Battery

                Get Battery Level

                Text
                  Battery: [Battery State]

                Show alert: Text

                Set variable SensorValue to Text

            Otherwise

                If SensorType contains Condition

                    Get Mobile Service network's Network Provider Name

                    Get Mobile Service network's Country Code

                    Get Mobile Service network's Radio Technology

                    Get Mobile Service network's Number of Signal Bars

                    Text
                      Condition: [Network Details], [Network Details], [Network Details], [Network Details]

                    Show alert: Text

                    Set variable SensorValue to Text

                Otherwise

                    If SensorType contains Availability

                        Get Wi-Fi network's Network Name

                        Get Wi-Fi network's Wi-Fi Standard

                        Get Wi-Fi network's RSSI

                        Get current IP address

                        Text
                          Availability: [Network Details], [Network Details], [Network Details], [Current IP Address]

                        Show alert: Text

                        Set variable SensorValue to Text

                    Otherwise

                        If SensorType contains Weather

                            Get current weather at Current Location

                            Get Condition from Weather Conditions

                            Get Temperature from Weather Conditions

                            Text
                              Weather: [Condition], [Temperature]

                            Set variable SensorValue to Text

                        Otherwise

                            If SensorType contains Manual

                                Type

                                Text
                                  Measurement: [Measurement]

                                Show alert: Text

                                Set variable SensorValue to Text

                            Otherwise

                                Show alert: No Sensor Type List

                            End If

                        End If

                    End If

                End If

            End If

        End If

    End If

    Show alert: If Result

    Get the System Version

    Set variable OperatorID to System Version

    Get contents of [Dictionary Value / URL field hidden in screenshot]
      Method: POST
      Headers:
        Content-Type: application/json
      Request Body: JSON
        sensor_type: SensorType
        sensor_value: SensorValue      
        operator_uoi: iPhone - OperatorID

    Show alert: Contents of URL

Otherwise

    Text
      No redirect - cannot capture IoT endpoint nor send IoT sensor data

End If
Show alert: If Result
Stop this shortcut
